/// fork_exit.stp /////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
/*
 * fork_exit.stp - Overlooks sched_fork()/exit_exit() for satprocess/satthread
 *                 and prints some information
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2007 Satoru Takeuchi <takeuchi_satoru@jp.fujitsu.com>
 *
